      },
      "message": "fix(wire): add heal_tolerance for bounded 2D swallowtail offsets\n\nAdd `heal_tolerance` to `WireRuled` and validate it at the\n`wire_contour_ruled` door. Pass `reach = k + heal_tolerance.max(COVER_TOL)`\nto `laws::cover_healed` on both planes while keeping `laws::kerf` strict\nat `PATH_TOL`. Emit an uncut-rest note when `COVER_TOL < d - k <=\nheal_tolerance`, and refuse larger rest with spot, depth, and bound.\n\nFixes #2693",
